{"version":1,"posts":[{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03","author":"lidianlong","createdAt":"2026-11-09T15:41:58.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":20,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03/media/restaurant-speaker.webp","alt":"餐馆墙角高处的音箱，下面是冰柜和碗","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"一进鼓就嗡嗡嗡，还往大了拧！"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-04","author":"guest-abba85ed70e2ba57","createdAt":"2026-11-09T15:43:07.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03/media/speaker-foam.webp","alt":"桌面音箱下垫着两块黑色泡棉，电线贴着桌边。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"不带遥控器"},"text":"在哪听的？我自己这台底下垫了两块泡棉，桌子不跟着震了。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-05","author":"visitor-gamma","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:10:48.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03","likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03/media/shop-door-speaker.webp","alt":"从修车铺门内看出去，对面店门前的音箱正朝着这边，近处挡着车轮和内胎。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"对门这个正冲我店门。收钱问个数都得喊。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-06","author":"lidianlong","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:27:44.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-04","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"吃饭这家！人跑去拧音箱，我那盘肉还没来。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-07","author":"guest-083d90acf67e10a7","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:29:37.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-06","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"白开水"},"text":"晚吃两分钟能饿死啊。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-15","author":"visitor-nu","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:29:29.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-07","likes":11,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"人家说音箱吵，你怎么光看见肉了"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-02","author":"guest-0d56d121f7345556","createdAt":"2026-11-09T15:40:57.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":34,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-02/media/lunch-tray.webp","alt":"食堂餐盘里的米饭、青菜和几块土豆","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"多加一勺"},"text":"到我就没鸡腿了，刚插进来那个人倒有。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-01","author":"guest-1e2fe820a736d8a0","createdAt":"2026-11-09T14:10:26.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":33,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"半杯豆浆"},"text":"昨晚楼道有人喊“把钥匙还我”，早上群里说小孩闹着玩。\n那声音比我爸还低，谁家小孩啊。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-09","author":"guest-6f38fac23469b5f9","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:31:50.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-01","likes":11,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"泡面没叉"},"text":"四百多个月的宝宝。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-10","author":"visitor-gamma-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:34:27.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-09","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-01/media/sock-under-sofa.webp","alt":"沙发与茶几之间的地砖上，一只灰袜子落在茶几腿旁。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"我家都五百多个月了，还问袜子在哪。就在茶几底下，他弯个腰会怎样啊"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-11","author":"guest-6f38fac23469b5f9","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:36:16.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-10","likes":10,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"泡面没叉"},"text":"那不是你惯的。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-12","author":"guest-1e2fe820a736d8a0","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:36:53.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-09","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"半杯豆浆"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-13","author":"visitor-gamma-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:39:23.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-11","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/angry.webp","alt":"L0皱眉张嘴指向一旁。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"袜子又不是我藏的。他不找，你先找着我的毛病了。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-14","author":"visitor-alpha-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:41:49.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-13","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"这也能怪你。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-15","author":"guest-103f56de044eee70","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:43:21.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-14","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"纸箱留着"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-16","author":"guest-9c81d3f9724f9b00","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:45:54.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-01","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-01/media/one-slipper.webp","alt":"楼道的小鞋架上只剩一只蓝拖鞋，旁边空着。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"周末不早起"},"text":"我们楼这个也说小孩拿去玩了。只拿一只，另一只还给我留架上。问哪家小孩，又没人回。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-17","author":"guest-1e2fe820a736d8a0","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:47:53.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-16","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"半杯豆浆"},"text":"小孩还挺忙。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-18","author":"visitor-chi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:49:38.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-17","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heated.webp","alt":"L0脸颊发红，双拳攥在胸前。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"宝宝的事你少管"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-19","author":"visitor-sigma","createdAt":"2026-11-09T17:00:24.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-01","likes":10,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我上周最后在画具盒里找着的，那个盒子之前明明翻过两次。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-06","author":"visitor-epsilon","createdAt":"2026-11-09T02:31:38.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"有些少儿书腰封比正文还吵，翻两页又是“你就是最棒的”。问推荐的人好在哪儿，只回我孩子爱看。\n那我也不知道怎么接。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05","author":"visitor-theta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T02:15:36.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":19,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/melon.webp","alt":"L0扒着边沿，双手拿一片西瓜。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"同学发作品，说“终于靠自己”。下面有人问是不是她叔叔那个项目，刚才再看，评论没了。\n（图是挺好看的）"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-15","author":"guest-0e8dc9736409183c","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:11:50.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/clap.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼拍着双手。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"番茄去皮"},"text":"终于靠自己喊了声叔叔。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-16","author":"visitor-theta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:22:57.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-15","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05/media/lavender-sample.webp","alt":"手里的淡紫卡纸上盖了几排花朵试印","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"她那个浅紫我还存了。我自己上次试印成这样，灰不灰？问她用什么纸没回，朋友圈倒是又发了。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-17","author":"guest-0e8dc9736409183c","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:24:13.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-16","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"番茄去皮"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-18","author":"visitor-theta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:26:35.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-17","likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"你笑什么啊？"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-19","author":"guest-c6990ce4e6399e47","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:27:52.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"断网十分钟"},"text":"也可能是问的人自己删的。你看见谁删了？"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-20","author":"guest-543b2df0f966a0e4","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:28:25.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-16","likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05/media/purple-paper-pair.webp","alt":"窗台上两片色调不同的紫色纸样","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"剪刀找不到"},"text":"你想要的是哪种？我这两张包装上都叫香芋紫，放一块根本不是一个色。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-21","author":"guest-543b2df0f966a0e4","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:28:52.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-18","likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"剪刀找不到"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-22","author":"visitor-theta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:34:06.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-20","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05/media/stamp-proof.webp","alt":"同一张花朵试印纸的平面扫描图","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"右边吧。扫出来又不一样了，实物偏灰，我想要再紫一点（这是我自己的试印）。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-23","author":"visitor-upsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:44:13.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"叔叔介绍的项目，图就不算她自己做的了？"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-24","author":"guest-6f9f9ffd47a5b90d","createdAt":"2026-11-09T14:00:45.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-23","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"拐个弯"},"text":"我现在的活也是亲戚介绍的，没人替我上班啊。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-25","author":"visitor-theta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T14:02:27.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-23","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heated.webp","alt":"L0脸颊发红，双拳攥在胸前。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"我说她没画了吗？我说的是那句“终于靠自己”。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-26","author":"visitor-delta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T14:03:38.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-22","likes":11,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05/media/curtain-colour.webp","alt":"浅紫窗帘被手拎起一角，叠在一起的部分更深，透光处接近灰色。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"会不会灯的问题。我家窗帘也是，叠起来紫，放下来灰的。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-27","author":"guest-6f9f9ffd47a5b90d","createdAt":"2026-11-09T14:04:54.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-24","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/leave.webp","alt":"L0向一旁迈步，回头看，身后有几条速度线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"拐个弯"},"text":"我小姨这会儿又在发相亲照片。工作介绍完就轮到这个了。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-28","author":"guest-c6990ce4e6399e47","createdAt":"2026-11-09T14:06:00.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/wait.webp","alt":"L0蹲着，双手托住脸，尾巴向一侧弯起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"断网十分钟"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-29","author":"guest-b07e234e6d77b831","createdAt":"2026-11-09T14:08:38.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-28","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/wait.webp","alt":"L0蹲着，双手托住脸，尾巴向一侧弯起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"橘子汽水"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04","author":"visitor-epsilon","createdAt":"2026-11-09T00:48:16.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":17,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04/media/window-lean.webp","alt":"窗边一盆绿萝的茎向同一侧伸出去","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"想把这盆转半圈。原来已经歪掉的茎，还会慢慢直回来吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-08","author":"guest-22ef89f6b2fe9221","createdAt":"2026-11-09T06:03:18.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"小陶盆"},"text":"什么植物啊？先说个名字呀"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-09","author":"guest-fec6b3d78d0a2be0","createdAt":"2026-11-09T06:05:14.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04/media/unknown-pothos.webp","alt":"玻璃杯中水培的一枝植物，根须挤满杯底","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/guilty.webp","alt":"L0缩着肩膀，双手抓着衣领，眼睛看向一侧。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"小绿活着就行"},"text":"我连自己这盆叫什么都不知道，养着就行吧"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-10","author":"guest-22ef89f6b2fe9221","createdAt":"2026-11-09T06:06:29.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-09","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04/media/round-leaf-pot.webp","alt":"水槽旁一盆圆叶植物，白色标签背面朝外","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"小陶盆"},"text":"我这个卖花的和识图软件各说一个，问到现在也没弄明白。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-11","author":"visitor-nu","createdAt":"2026-11-09T08:31:44.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-10","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"你自己也叫不上来，刚才还那么凶"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-12","author":"visitor-latebell","createdAt":"2026-11-09T08:33:11.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04/media/plastic-plant.webp","alt":"白方盆里的仿真植物，石子中露出塑料接头","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"我这盆，转了一学期了，一点没长"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-13","author":"guyu","createdAt":"2026-11-09T09:28:07.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-12","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"你这盆是塑料的吧？"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-14","author":"visitor-psi","createdAt":"2026-11-09T09:34:39.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-13","likes":10,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/melon.webp","alt":"L0扒着边沿，双手拿一片西瓜。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-03","author":"guest-4881a4db9a0a8f5a","createdAt":"2026-11-09T00:46:55.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/sweat.webp","alt":"L0额头挂着一大滴汗，嘴角翘起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"下午再说"},"text":"说帮忙改两行，发过来六页，真有你的。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-02","author":"visitor-epsilon","createdAt":"2026-11-09T00:28:57.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"过了！手机差点砸脸。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-07","author":"visitor-omicron","createdAt":"2026-11-09T02:32:39.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-02","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"手机还想过你脸这一关"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-01","author":"chenanjing","createdAt":"2026-11-09T00:04:12.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-01/media/white-paper.webp","alt":"一张亮白色的纸铺在有划痕的棕色木桌上，纸角微微翘起。","kind":"image"}],"text":"这纸白得像开了灯，样图里那点灰呢。\n店家说是我屏幕的问题。"},{"id":"site-welcome","author":"site-admin","createdAt":"2026-11-08T00:00:00+08:00","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"入站须知\n\n欢迎来到路西法零。自由表达的商业承诺现已生效。\n\n01 禁止使用 AI 发帖。\n02 引用请带帖号。\n03 吵架留在原串。\n04 禁止刷屏。\n05 可以删帖。不限制截图。\n06 管理员保留解释权。\n\n访问权限\n\n本站目前采用内测邀请制，发帖权限随邀请开放。"}]}
